at up as one of his  crimes along with being smug cocky  elitist and arrogant Vegeta's list of  evil deeds sometimes crosses the line of  criminal stupidity like when he allows  cell to achieve his perfect form only to  then be taken down by that form he might  have eventually ended up as the perfect  family man at Earth's great champion but  he's still no angel and never will be  and there you have it the top 10 anime  good guys who started off bad I hope you  enjoyed watching this video as much as I  did making it give it a like if you did  you can also drop me a line and tell me  what you think of this selection or if  there are characters that you think  should be on this list  let's have a conversation about it don't  forget to check out our sponsors game  aura Kingdom the links in the  description ciao  [Music]
 

